      {
        "text": "And behold, if ye shall say that God shall smite this people, it shall come to pass.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Helaman 10:10",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 10,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "And now behold, I command you, that ye shall go and declare unto this people, that thus saith the Lord God, who is the Almighty: Except ye repent ye shall be smitten, even unto destruction.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 177,
